sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Y as Yurist
  participant A as Advokat
  participant S as DataRequestService
  participant B as BillingService
  participant Q as Horizon (Redis navbat)
  participant G as MockGovProvider → idora
  participant R as Reverb
  participant AI as AiService
  participant L as AuditLogger

  Y->>S: create() — loyiha (status draft)
  S->>S: checkBasis() — jonli tekshiruv
  S->>L: RequestCreated
  Y->>S: requestSignature() → awaiting_signature
  S->>L: RequestCreated (sent_for_signature)
  Note over A,S: Advokat ishning asosini qo'shgan:<br/>sud ajrimi yoki advokat orderi (LegalBasisVerifier::verify)
  A->>S: signAndSubmit()
  S->>S: LicenseChecker::refresh() — litsenziya faolmi?
  alt litsenziya faol emas
    S->>L: RequestBlocked (license_inactive)
    S-->>A: 403 imzolash huquqi to'xtatilgan
  end
  S->>S: checkBasis() (shaxs + tur + muddat)
  alt asos qamramaydi
    S->>L: RequestBlocked (sabab)
    S-->>A: 422 sabab matni
  end
  S->>S: RequestDeadline::compute() — due_at, deadline_basis
  rect rgb(238,244,255)
    Note over S,B: DB tranzaksiyasi
    S->>B: chargeForRequest()
    B->>L: Charge
    B-->>S: InsufficientBalance bo'lsa 422
    S->>S: ERI imzo (demo: sha256 imzo xeshi)
    S->>L: RequestSigned
    S->>S: transition → submitted
    S->>L: RequestSubmitted
  end
  S->>R: RequestStatusUpdated
  S->>Q: SubmitGovRequestJob
  Q->>G: POST /requests (GovSubmission)
  alt transport xatosi 3 marta
    Q->>S: transition → failed + refund()
    S->>L: ResponseReceived (technical_failure), Refund
  else qabul qilindi
    G-->>Q: request_id
    Q->>S: transition → processing
    S->>R: RequestStatusUpdated
  end
  loop FetchGovResultJob — har 2 s, 30 martagacha
    Q->>G: GET /requests/{id}
  end
  alt completed
    Q->>G: result()
    Q->>S: RequestResponse (payload shifrlangan, expires_at = +30 kun)<br/>transition → completed
    S->>L: ResponseReceived
    S->>R: RequestStatusUpdated
    Q->>AI: AnalyzeResponseJob → analyzeResponse()
    AI->>L: AiAnalysis
  else rejected
    Q->>S: transition → rejected + refund()
    S->>L: ResponseReceived (rejected), Refund
  else 30 urinishda javob yo'q
    Q->>S: transition → failed + refund()
  end
  R-->>A: private-case.{id}, private-user.{id}
